# packages/web — frontend build environment (Vite / Vercel)
#
# Vite only inlines variables prefixed with VITE_. This is the sole key the web
# app reads (see src/vite-env.d.ts and src/copilot/client.ts). It is a PUBLIC
# origin, not a secret — never put a secret in a VITE_ variable (Rule 10).
#
# Edge gateway origin for the Copilot / EVP calls. Leave empty for same-origin
# (the Cloudflare Pages topology where the Worker answers on the same host). On
# a Vercel-hosted frontend, set it to the deployed Worker URL, e.g.:
#
#   VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://urbanflow-edge.<subdomain>.workers.dev
#
# When you set this, the exact same origin must appear in ALLOWED_ORIGINS in
# packages/edge/wrangler.toml, or every browser request fails preflight with
# 403 ORIGIN_FORBIDDEN (docs/DEPLOY.md §2 "Cross-origin edge gateway").
VITE_API_BASE_URL=
